<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h2 data-lake-id="hDedJ" id="hDedJ" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u6ebf084b" id="u6ebf084b">🐧</span><span data-lake-id="ud4f41c81" id="ud4f41c81"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1d68bc64" id="u1d68bc64">𝐅𝐏𝟖 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></strong></h2><p data-lake-id="u24bf79d7" id="u24bf79d7"><strong><span data-lake-id="uda0299f1" id="uda0299f1">受近期低精度训练研究进展的启发，作者提出一种采用 FP8 数据格式的细粒度混合精度框架，用于训练 DeepSeek-V3</span></strong></p><ul list="u431fb6c5"><li fid="u02c11876" data-lake-id="u15c18d9b" id="u15c18d9b"><span data-lake-id="u84bbc8a7" id="u84bbc8a7">尽管低精度训练具有巨大潜力，但其应用通常受到激活、权重和梯度中离群值的限制。虽然推理量化已经取得显著进展，但能够证明低精度技术成功应用于大规模语言模型预训练的研究仍相对较少</span></li><li fid="u02c11876" data-lake-id="u8276f754" id="u8276f754"><span data-lake-id="u1b9d6ff7" id="u1b9d6ff7">为应对这一挑战并有效扩展 FP8 格式的动态范围，作者引入一种细粒度量化策略：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uad1de805" id="uad1de805">采用包含</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%20%5C%5Ctimes%20N_c%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb68c8917fd4ecdbe92b7f871e8c43975.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s1Sax%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3b4dc08d" id="u3b4dc08d">个元素的 tile 级分组，或包含</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N_c%20%5C%5Ctimes%20N_c%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9d93b5cc0e5960249341c8885071647e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C57zJ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u854f3338" id="u854f3338">个元素的 block 级分组。相应的反量化开销在提高累加精度的过程中得到大幅缓解，而这一过程是实现精确的 FP8 通用矩阵乘法的关键。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2b53ba54" id="u2b53ba54">此外，为进一步降低 MoE 训练中的内存和通信开销，作者使用 FP8 缓存和分发激活，同时使用 BF16 存储低精度优化器状态</span></li><li fid="u02c11876" data-lake-id="ub8634898" id="ub8634898"><span data-lake-id="uc12c1b81" id="uc12c1b81">作者在与 DeepSeek-V2-Lite 和 DeepSeek-V2 规模相近的两种模型上验证所提出的 FP8 混合精度框架，并进行约 1 万亿 token 的训练。值得注意的是，与 BF16 基线相比，采用 FP8 训练的模型，其损失值的相对误差始终低于 0.25%，这一水平完全处于训练随机性所允许的可接受范围内</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua0135341" id="ua0135341" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790638025670-d8f42b2e-7d0a-42e3-87b0-1d1c2dc305e7.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u5ec60755-5520-45ad-a83d-21d2770445b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u58899e26-5083-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A753.6000366210938%2C%22height%22%3A218%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A66220%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1022%2C%22originHeight%22%3A295%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22GRADIENT%22%2C%22x%22%3A37%2C%22y%22%3A251%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RADIEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A481%2C%22y%22%3A250%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPU%22%2C%22x%22%3A485%2C%22y%22%3A70%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WEIGHT%22%2C%22x%22%3A890%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOFP8%22%2C%22x%22%3A602%2C%22y%22%3A225%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OPTIMIZE%22%2C%22x%22%3A880%2C%22y%22%3A151%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MASTER%22%2C%22x%22%3A703%2C%22y%22%3A151%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOFP8%22%2C%22x%22%3A392%2C%22y%22%3A149%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GRADIENT%22%2C%22x%22%3A885%2C%22y%22%3A82%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOFP8%22%2C%22x%22%3A600%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WEIGHT%22%2C%22x%22%3A258%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A52%2C%22y%22%3A70%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOBF16%22%2C%22x%22%3A390%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOBF16%22%2C%22x%22%3A135%2C%22y%22%3A225%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STATES%22%2C%22x%22%3A889%2C%22y%22%3A173%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WEIGHT%22%2C%22x%22%3A699%2C%22y%22%3A172%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A480%2C%22y%22%3A229%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOFP8%22%2C%22x%22%3A392%2C%22y%22%3A226%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A40%2C%22y%22%3A230%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFP32%22%2C%22x%22%3A802%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BF16%22%2C%22x%22%3A484%2C%22y%22%3A274%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FP32%22%2C%22x%22%3A891%2C%22y%22%3A104%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FP32%22%2C%22x%22%3A219%2C%22y%22%3A269%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DGRAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A259%2C%22y%22%3A218%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BF16%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A97%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BF16%22%2C%22x%22%3A968%2C%22y%22%3A123%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WGRAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A679%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FPROP%22%2C%22x%22%3A265%2C%22y%22%3A46%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFP8%22%2C%22x%22%3A140%2C%22y%22%3A58%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FP32%22%2C%22x%22%3A734%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CP32%22%2C%22x%22%3A316%2C%22y%22%3A96%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T6%22%2C%22x%22%3A965%2C%22y%22%3A109%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2f1ed%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u274143c3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ucf00c3d8" id="ucf00c3d8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u79a3b936" id="u79a3b936">基于低精度训练中广泛采用的技术，作者提出一种用于 FP8 训练的混合精度框架。在该框架中，大多数计算密集型操作采用 FP8 执行，而少数关键操作则有选择地保留其原始数据格式，以平衡训练效率与数值稳定性</span></strong></p><ul list="u092a2d64"><li fid="u45f1b817" data-lake-id="u558fe5c7" id="u558fe5c7"><span data-lake-id="ua9e9a058" id="ua9e9a058">首先，为加速模型训练，大多数核心计算内核，即 GEMM 操作，均采用 FP8 精度实现。这些 GEMM 操作以 FP8 张量作为输入，并生成 BF16 或 FP32 格式的输出。与 Linear 算子相关的三个 GEMM，即 Fprop（前向传播）、Dgrad（激活的反向传播）和 Wgrad（权重的反向传播），均以 FP8 执行</span></li><li fid="u45f1b817" data-lake-id="u74066f29" id="u74066f29"><span data-lake-id="u83abba59" id="u83abba59">与原始 BF16 方法相比，这一设计在理论上能够使计算速度翻倍。此外，采用 FP8 的 Wgrad GEMM 允许以 FP8 格式存储激活，供反向传播使用，从而显著降低内存消耗</span></li><li fid="u45f1b817" data-lake-id="ua59264b7" id="ua59264b7"><span data-lake-id="ud72fcfcf" id="ud72fcfcf">尽管 FP8 格式具有效率优势，但某些算子对低精度计算较为敏感，仍然需要更高精度。此外，一些计算成本较低的算子也可以使用更高精度，而由此增加的开销相对于整体训练成本可以忽略不计。因此，经过仔细研究，作者为以下组件保留原始精度（例如 BF16 或 FP32）：嵌入模块、输出头、MoE 门控模块、归一化算子和注意力算子。这些有针对性的高精度保留措施确保 DeepSeek-V3 训练动态的稳定性</span></li><li fid="u45f1b817" data-lake-id="ub45b09d9" id="ub45b09d9"><span data-lake-id="ua601cf9d" id="ua601cf9d">为进一步保证数值稳定性，作者以更高精度存储主权重、权重梯度和优化器状态。虽然这些高精度组件会带来一定的内存开销，但在分布式训练系统中，通过在多个数据并行 rank 之间进行高效分片，可以最大限度地降低其影响</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc1bbcf42" id="uc1bbcf42" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790638476904-f1a64c9d-d1b4-4d9a-bf0b-0338235f7652.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u092833e9-4358-4e41-894e-900d9e39c90%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9bfd7026-d081-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A806.4%2C%22height%22%3A424%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A87306%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1008%2C%22originHeight%22%3A530%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%8C%22%2C%22x%22%3A658%2C%22y%22%3A86%2C%22width%22%3A156%2C%22height%22%3A133%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(B)LNCREASINGACCUMULATIONPRECISION%22%2C%22x%22%3A660%2C%22y%22%3A491%2C%22width%22%3A302%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A)FINE-GRAINEDGUANTIZATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A193%2C%22y%22%3A492%2C%22width%22%3A233%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WGMMA4%22%2C%22x%22%3A846%2C%22y%22%3A75%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CUDACORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A645%2C%22y%22%3A424%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TENSORCORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A652%2C%22y%22%3A247%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FP32REGISTER%22%2C%22x%22%3A837%2C%22y%22%3A420%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A635%2C%22y%22%3A308%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2FGEMMINPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A808%2C%22y%22%3A244%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A43%2C%22y%22%3A392%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SCALINGFACTO%22%2C%22x%22%3A840%2C%22y%22%3A399%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CUDACORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A47%2C%22y%22%3A453%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOWPRECACC%22%2C%22x%22%3A844%2C%22y%22%3A221%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WGMMA%22%2C%22x%22%3A653%2C%22y%22%3A74%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NTERVA%22%2C%22x%22%3A880%2C%22y%22%3A355%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SCALINC%22%2C%22x%22%3A47%2C%22y%22%3A77%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WEIGHT%22%2C%22x%22%3A396%2C%22y%22%3A46%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SCALING%22%2C%22x%22%3A403%2C%22y%22%3A93%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FACTOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A402%2C%22y%22%3A109%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FACTOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A56%2C%22y%22%3A95%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TENSORCORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A47%2C%22y%22%3A348%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NG%22%2C%22x%22%3A887%2C%22y%22%3A328%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A48%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A779%2C%22y%22%3A243%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NC%22%2C%22x%22%3A466%2C%22y%22%3A175%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VC%22%2C%22x%22%3A75%2C%22y%22%3A163%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NC%22%2C%22x%22%3A425%2C%22y%22%3A213%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f7f6%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u1f99e80f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u48702e2e" id="u48702e2e"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc8faa333" id="uc8faa333">细粒度量化。在低精度训练框架中，上溢和下溢是常见问题，其原因在于 FP8 格式的指数位较少，动态范围受到限制。通常的做法是，将输入张量的最大绝对值缩放至 FP8 可表示的最大值，使输入分布与 FP8 格式的可表示范围相匹配。这种方法使低精度训练对激活中的离群值高度敏感，可能严重降低量化精度。为解决这一问题，作者提出一种细粒度量化方法，在更细的粒度上进行缩放</span></strong></p><ul list="ud0b5a0d0"><li fid="u5c6fb50b" data-lake-id="u49829947" id="u49829947"><span data-lake-id="u27ae52be" id="u27ae52be">对于激活，以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%20%5C%5Ctimes%20128%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2e697c8a674440e2c4af32781563e951.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CIasc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufe8881e1" id="ufe8881e1">的 tile 为单位对元素进行分组和缩放，即每个 token 的每 128 个通道为一组；对于权重，以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22128%20%5C%5Ctimes%20128%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F57a55880734793a1bc170f5c634b0c74.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P6O19%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue59ee81b" id="ue59ee81b">的 block 为单位对元素进行分组和缩放，即每 128 个输入通道与每 128 个输出通道构成一组。通过根据更小的元素组调整缩放尺度，这种方法能够使量化过程更好地适应离群值</span></li><li fid="u5c6fb50b" data-lake-id="u10bd5192" id="u10bd5192"><span data-lake-id="ud300fdc3" id="ud300fdc3">该方法的一项关键修改，是沿 GEMM 操作的内部维度引入逐组缩放因子。标准 FP8 GEMM 并不直接支持这一功能。然而，将其与精确的 FP32 累加策略结合后，便可以高效实现</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0bebd124" id="u0bebd124"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7b8d3e98" id="u7b8d3e98">提高累加精度。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u97cd52c2" id="u97cd52c2">低精度 GEMM 操作通常面临下溢问题，其准确性在很大程度上依赖于高精度累加，而高精度累加通常采用 FP32 精度执行。然而，作者观察到，NVIDIA H800 GPU 上 FP8 GEMM 的累加精度仅能保留约 14 位，显著低于 FP32 的累加精度。当内部维度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k2zps%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0dd796c3" id="u0dd796c3">较大时，这一问题会更加突出</span></p><ul list="ue853cefa"><li fid="u179ba448" data-lake-id="u86cb332c" id="u86cb332c"><span data-lake-id="ua4a92b11" id="ua4a92b11">随着批大小和模型宽度的增加，这种情况在大规模模型训练中十分常见。以两个随机矩阵在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%20%3D%204096%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F36c02df76659b7fd539ceb8ffb4e5d56.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22idGZT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4de0e7f1" id="u4de0e7f1">时的 GEMM 操作为例，在初步测试中，Tensor Core 有限的累加精度导致最大相对误差接近 2%。尽管存在这些问题，有限精度累加仍然是一些 FP8 框架的默认选项，严重限制训练准确性</span></li><li fid="u179ba448" data-lake-id="uf226e324" id="uf226e324"><span data-lake-id="uf5be06c4" id="uf5be06c4">作者采用将计算转移至 CUDA Core 以提高精度的策略。在 Tensor Core 上执行 MMA 时，中间结果使用有限位宽进行累加。每当累加间隔达到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N_C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed8d2849bfe5f97caec443f2bdc71250.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AtEcJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1660a1b9" id="u1660a1b9">时，这些部分结果便会被复制到 CUDA Core 上的 FP32 寄存器中，并在那里进行全精度 FP32 累加。如前所述，细粒度量化沿内部维度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OOmk6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5afdaed3" id="u5afdaed3">应用逐组缩放因子。在反量化过程中，可以在 CUDA Core 上高效地完成这些缩放因子的乘法运算，所增加的计算成本很小</span></li><li fid="u179ba448" data-lake-id="u7841d879" id="u7841d879"><span data-lake-id="u01c252e7" id="u01c252e7">这一修改会降低单个 warpgroup 的 WGMMA 指令发射速率。然而，在 H800 架构上，通常有两个 WGMMA 并发驻留：当一个 warpgroup 执行精度提升操作时，另一个可以执行 MMA 操作。这一设计使两种操作能够重叠执行，从而维持 Tensor Core 的高利用率。实验表明，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N_C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed8d2849bfe5f97caec443f2bdc71250.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S4HHo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua035487a" id="ua035487a">设置为 128 个元素，相当于 4 次 WGMMA 操作，是能够显著提高精度且不会引入明显开销的最小累加间隔</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4dafd06d" id="u4dafd06d"><strong><span data-lake-id="uddabe755" id="uddabe755">尾数优先于指数。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u47221579" id="u47221579">先前研究采用混合 FP8 格式，在 Fprop 中使用 E4M3，在 Dgrad 和 Wgrad 中使用 E5M2</span></p><ul list="ue7b85a37"><li fid="uce188587" data-lake-id="uaf1c9eb3" id="uaf1c9eb3"><span data-lake-id="u175726de" id="u175726de">与此不同，作者对所有张量均采用 E4M3 格式，以获得更高精度。作者将这一方法的可行性归因于细粒度量化策略，即 tile 级和 block 级缩放。通过对更小的元素组进行操作，该方法实际上使同组元素共享指数位，从而缓解动态范围有限所带来的影响</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4414afe3" id="u4414afe3"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1a7a7f41" id="u1a7a7f41">在线量化。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub581073a" id="ub581073a">逐张量量化框架采用延迟量化，保留先前迭代中最大绝对值的历史记录，以推断当前值</span></p><ul list="u432abb70"><li fid="u2113cd11" data-lake-id="ued3449f6" id="ued3449f6"><span data-lake-id="ufd7d2ae4" id="ufd7d2ae4">为确保缩放尺度准确并简化框架，作者在线计算每个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%20%5C%5Ctimes%20128%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2e697c8a674440e2c4af32781563e951.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22US1r3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u09a50191" id="u09a50191">激活 tile 或</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22128%20%5C%5Ctimes%20128%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F57a55880734793a1bc170f5c634b0c74.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XqVbM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u76cfaad9" id="u76cfaad9">权重 block 的最大绝对值，据此确定缩放因子，再在线将激活或权重量化为 FP8 格式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf410f234" id="uf410f234"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5bbabb0a" id="u5bbabb0a" style="color: #70000D">结合 FP8 训练框架，作者通过将缓存的激活和优化器状态压缩为更低精度的格式，进一步降低内存消耗和通信开销</span></strong></p><ul list="u2084f4de"><li fid="uf5764160" data-lake-id="u291eecb5" id="u291eecb5"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc45b4485" id="uc45b4485">低精度优化器状态。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5d2b96ef" id="u5d2b96ef">作者采用 BF16 数据格式代替 FP32，记录 AdamW 优化器中的一阶矩和二阶矩，且未观察到性能下降。然而，主权重（由优化器存储）和梯度（用于批量累积）仍保留为 FP32，以确保整个训练过程中的数值稳定性</span></li><li fid="uf5764160" data-lake-id="u8b3c8947" id="u8b3c8947"><strong><span data-lake-id="u04cd3a67" id="u04cd3a67">低精度激活。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0f596998" id="u0f596998">Wgrad 操作采用 FP8 执行。为降低内存消耗，以 FP8 格式缓存激活并将其用于 Linear 算子的反向传播，是一种自然的选择。不过，为实现低成本的高精度训练，作者对若干算子进行特殊处理：</span></li></ul><ul list="u2084f4de" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="uf5764160" data-lake-id="u8216b6ed" id="u8216b6ed"><strong><span data-lake-id="u44d86d72" id="u44d86d72">注意力算子之后的 Linear 算子的输入。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0ee8793e" id="u0ee8793e">这些激活也用于注意力算子的反向传播，因此对精度较为敏感。作者专门为这些激活采用定制的 E5M6 数据格式。此外，在反向传播中，这些激活将由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%20%5C%5Ctimes%20128%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2e697c8a674440e2c4af32781563e951.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mayti%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf72ca8e1" id="uf72ca8e1">的量化 tile 转换为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22128%20%5C%5Ctimes%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb9b6d0bb7b899d69008b3f8eccc2d20d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vBtFz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u85afbae8" id="u85afbae8">的 tile。为避免引入额外的量化误差，所有缩放因子均经过舍入处理，即取为 2 的整数次幂</span></li><li fid="uf5764160" data-lake-id="u5ef8ca51" id="u5ef8ca51"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud94ccf76" id="ud94ccf76">MoE 中 SwiGLU 算子的输入。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u25221aaa" id="u25221aaa">为进一步降低内存成本，作者缓存 SwiGLU 算子的输入，并在反向传播中重新计算其输出。这些激活同样采用细粒度量化方法，以 FP8 格式存储，从而在内存效率和计算准确性之间取得平衡</span></li></ul><ul list="u2084f4de" start="3"><li fid="uf5764160" data-lake-id="ub3dae272" id="ub3dae272"><strong><span data-lake-id="u25fd0f5e" id="u25fd0f5e">低精度通信。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubb7e7b14" id="ubb7e7b14">通信带宽是 MoE 模型训练中的一个关键瓶颈。为缓解这一问题，作者先将 MoE 上投影之前的激活量化为 FP8，再执行分发（dispatch）操作，这与 MoE 上投影中的 FP8 Fprop 相兼容。与注意力算子之后的 Linear 算子的输入相同，这些激活的缩放因子也取为 2 的整数次幂。类似策略也应用于 MoE 下投影之前的激活梯度。对于前向和反向过程中的合并（combine）组件，均保留 BF16，以维持训练流程中关键环节的训练精度</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="FxK6A" id="FxK6A" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u9b7cfe18" id="u9b7cfe18">🦚 𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐃𝐞𝐩𝐥𝐨𝐲𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uf6d535fb" id="uf6d535fb"><strong><span data-lake-id="uaa563acc" id="uaa563acc">作者将 DeepSeek-V3 部署在 H800 集群上，其中每个节点内部的 GPU 通过 NVLink 互连，集群中的所有 GPU 则通过 IB 实现全互连。为同时满足在线服务的服务水平目标并保持高吞吐量，作者采用以下部署策略，将预填充（prefilling）阶段与解码（decoding）阶段分离</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uac8b53d6" id="uac8b53d6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u20a44641" id="u20a44641" style="color: #663000">预填充阶段的最小部署单元由 4 个节点组成，共包含 32 个 GPU。注意力部分采用 4 路张量并行（TP4）和序列并行（SP），并结合 8 路数据并行（DP8）。张量并行规模仅为 4，有助于限制 TP 通信开销。MoE 部分采用 32 路专家并行（EP32），确保每个专家处理足够大的批次，从而提高计算效率</span></strong></p><ul list="u5741b51c"><li fid="u32e41dda" data-lake-id="u31b5d0f0" id="u31b5d0f0"><span data-lake-id="u5a1012fe" id="u5a1012fe">对于 MoE 的 all-to-all 通信，作者采用与训练时相同的方法：首先通过 IB 跨节点传输 token，再通过 NVLink 在节点内部的 GPU 之间进行转发。特别地，浅层中的稠密 MLP 采用 1 路张量并行，以减少 TP 通信开销</span></li><li fid="u32e41dda" data-lake-id="u8dd67216" id="u8dd67216"><span data-lake-id="u076c22a2" id="u076c22a2">为实现 MoE 部分不同专家之间的负载均衡，需要确保每个 GPU 处理的 token 数量大致相同。为此，作者引入冗余专家部署策略，即复制高负载专家，并对其进行冗余部署。高负载专家根据在线部署期间收集的统计信息进行识别，并定期调整，例如每 10 分钟调整一次。确定冗余专家集合后，作者根据观测到的负载，在节点内部的 GPU 之间精细调整专家的分布，力求在不增加跨节点 all-to-all 通信开销的情况下，尽可能平衡各 GPU 的负载</span></li><li fid="u32e41dda" data-lake-id="uc56c16bd" id="uc56c16bd"><span data-lake-id="u9be9e280" id="u9be9e280">在 DeepSeek-V3 的部署中，预填充阶段设置 32 个冗余专家。每个 GPU 除部署原有的 8 个专家外，还额外部署 1 个冗余专家</span></li><li fid="u32e41dda" data-lake-id="ue77db8e9" id="ue77db8e9"><span data-lake-id="u0b57ab90" id="u0b57ab90">在预填充阶段，为提高吞吐量并隐藏 all-to-all 和 TP 通信开销，作者同时处理两个计算负载相近的微批次，使一个微批次的注意力计算和 MoE 计算，与另一个微批次的分发（dispatch）和合并（combine）操作重叠执行</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u22259db7" id="u22259db7"><strong><span data-lake-id="uab3aff28" id="uab3aff28" style="color: #663000">在解码阶段，作者将共享专家视为路由专家。从这一角度看，每个 token 在路由时会选择 9 个专家，其中共享专家被视为一个始终会被选中的高负载专家。解码阶段的最小部署单元由 40 个节点组成，共包含 320 个 GPU。注意力部分采用 TP4 和 SP，并结合 DP80；MoE 部分则采用 EP320</span></strong></p><ul list="u48ef41fc"><li fid="uac31dced" data-lake-id="u2ed354b6" id="u2ed354b6"><span data-lake-id="u1c7968bc" id="u1c7968bc">在 MoE 部分，每个 GPU 仅部署 1 个专家，其中 64 个 GPU 负责部署冗余专家和共享专家。分发与合并部分的 all-to-all 通信通过 IB 上的直接点对点传输完成，以实现低延迟。此外，作者采用 IBGDA 技术，进一步降低延迟并提高通信效率</span></li><li fid="uac31dced" data-lake-id="u2d1a2902" id="u2d1a2902"><span data-lake-id="udf8e16f0" id="udf8e16f0">与预填充阶段类似，作者根据在线服务中统计得到的专家负载，按一定时间间隔确定冗余专家集合。不过，由于每个 GPU 仅部署 1 个专家，因此无需重新调整专家分布。作者也在探索适用于解码阶段的动态冗余策略。然而，这需要更精细地优化全局最优路由方案的计算算法，并将其与分发内核融合，以降低开销</span></li><li fid="uac31dced" data-lake-id="ubbde40d4" id="ubbde40d4"><span data-lake-id="uf9f294b0" id="uf9f294b0">为提高吞吐量并隐藏 all-to-all 通信开销，作者还在探索于解码阶段同时处理两个计算负载相近的微批次。与预填充阶段不同，注意力计算在解码阶段占用的时间比例更大。因此，作者将一个微批次的注意力计算，与另一个微批次的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u79b3c7a7" id="u79b3c7a7">分发 + MoE + 合并</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u86ba1e67" id="u86ba1e67">操作重叠执行。在解码阶段，每个专家处理的批次相对较小，通常不超过 256 个 token，其瓶颈在于内存访问而非计算</span></li><li fid="uac31dced" data-lake-id="u5ed0ecd6" id="u5ed0ecd6"><span data-lake-id="ub10178d7" id="ub10178d7">由于 MoE 部分只需加载一个专家的参数，内存访问开销很小，因此使用较少的 SM 不会显著影响整体性能。由此，为避免影响注意力部分的计算速度，可以仅为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="udd348df4" id="udd348df4">分发 + MoE + 合并</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4a5a1085" id="u4a5a1085">分配少量 SM</span></li></ul>